Cortés was at the service of King Charles V of Spain under the directive to conquer land in the New World and to give power to the Spanish empire. {{source|wikipedia:Hernán_Cortés|Wikipedia}}

After long years of travels, he obtained the [[Ring]] of Umbra the Shadow Jaguar while in the Yucatan. When he died, he left it in a vault deep in the [[:Category:Sea of Cortés|Sea of Cortés]] off the coast of [[Baja California, Mexico]], along with the rest of his treasures. To guard it he left [[Conquistador]], a large Titan adept at relentlessly watching over treasure.{{source|The Power of Umbra}}

[[Dante Vale]] was able to locate Cortés' vault with help from [[Galen]] who possesses an impressive collection of Cortés's old maps and records. Using [[Metagolem]] and [[Ignatius]], he found the treasure protected by a force field and guarded by Conquistador. {{source|Gremlow Infestation}} The Huntik team returned to the vault with the [[Pied Pipe]] to charm Conquistador into letting them in, however they were ambushed by [[the Organization]] led by [[Wilder]]. After a turbulent battle, Dante obtained Umbra's ring but him and his team were trapped with Conquistador when [[Hoffman]] destroyed their exit. They escaped using Umbra's teleport ability.{{source|The Power of Umbra}}
